:: recordsampleconv [conversation regular] {"position":"1500,725","size":"100,100"}
(set: $currentPassage to "conversation")
<audio id="audioClip" preload="auto" controls>
<source src="https://repository.dri.ie/objects/s178j820k/files/sx61t876j/download?type=surrogate">
</audio>

<table border="0">
<tr><th>Transcription</th><th>Translation</th></tr>
<tr><td>"Dia dhuit."</td><td>Hello</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Dia is Muire dhuit."</td><td>Hello.</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Conas tánn tú?"</td><td>How are you?</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Cuíosach, slán go rabhais. Conas tá tú féin?"</td><td>Middling, thank you. How are you?</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Ní gearánta dhom, baochas le Dia."</td><td>I can't complain, thank God.</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Bhfuil aon scéal nua agat?"</td><td>Have you any news?</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Níl focal. Bhfuil agat féin?"</td><td>Not a word. How about yourself?</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Níl, mhuise."</td><td>No, indeed.</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Cad é an t-am é, más é do thoil é?"</td><td>What time is it please?</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Tá sé a hocht a chlog."</td><td>It is eight o'clock.</td></tr>
<tr><td>"Is mithid dom bheith ag dul abhaile."</td><td>It is time for me to be going home.</td></tr>
<tr><td> "Tóg bog an saol! Tá sé luath fós."</td><td>Take it easy! It is early yet.</td></tr>
<tr><td> "Tá sé déanach go leor. Slán agat."</td><td>It is late enough. Goodbye.</td></tr>
<tr><td> "Slán leat is go n-éirí do bhóthar leat."</td><td>Goodbye and good luck on your journey.</td></tr>
</table>

